# Allow only public application/build inputs into the Docker build context.
# Local .env files, recordings, output, workspace, .git and .venv stay on the host.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!examples/
!examples/*.md
!examples/*.ssml
!benchmarks/
!benchmarks/*.json

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
